## Installation Requirements

This version of Create runs on Forge and NeoForge. Install one of these loaders before adding Create to your game.Alternatively, you can find a ported project compatible with the Fabric ecosystem here.As of 0.5.1, the rendering library Flywheel no longer has to be installed separately.
